{"total_count":12,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192/events","html_url":"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192","id":1342280993,"node_id":"I_kwDOE1yAw85QAZUh","number":3192,"title":"More POI info for toilets and showers","user":{"login":"Outlet2048","id":72819077,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyODE5MDc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72819077?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048","html_url":"https://github.com/Outlet2048","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Outlet2048/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2615981366,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjE1OTgxMzY2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/Raw%20Idea","name":"Raw Idea","color":"07B2B3","default":false,"description":"An idea that needs to be elaborated","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4572829286,"node_id":"LA_kwDOE1yAw88AAAABEI_WZg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/POI%20Info","name":"POI Info","color":"F95207","default":false,"description":"Feature metadata, OSM tags that are displayed in Place Page","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2022-08-17T20:52:01Z","updated_at":"2023-11-10T11:48:17Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"_This issue is a part of my collection of camping related suggestions and improvements, which can be found here: https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/discussions/3189_\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThere have been multiple issues that aim to improve the information displayed for public toilets:\r\n\r\n#2849\r\n#2707\r\n#2254\r\n\r\nMostly these are about showing whether or not a toilet is free to use and the fee, if any.\r\nIt would be useful to get the same amount of information for public showers (present on camping sites for example)\r\n\r\nI suggest displaying information for the following tags:\r\n- [Fee](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:fee)\r\n- [Charge](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:charge)\r\n- [Payment methods](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:payment)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/3192/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/6518","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/