n> 2. And also, maybe 'Toilet' should be shown at the same zoom level as 'Drinking Water' as that's probably the same level of importance.  ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/6953/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/6953/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376/events","html_url":"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376","id":3429577748,"node_id":"I_kwDOE1yAw87MazQU","number":11376,"title":"Indicate if toilets are freely accessible","user":{"login":"cimm","id":68112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTEy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm","html_url":"https://github.com/cimm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cimm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":4572829286,"node_id":"LA_kwDOE1yAw88AAAABEI_WZg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/POI%20Info","name":"POI Info","color":"F95207","default":false,"description":"Feature metadata, OSM tags that are displayed in Place Page","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-18T09:54:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T15:42:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":13844712,"node_id":"IT_kwDOBJG7o84A00Do","name":"Feature","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","color":"blue","created_at":"2024-02-08T03:47:05Z","updated_at":"2024-10-08T17:53:37Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\n\nOften, while visiting a city for example, I have to quickly find a nearby toilet. People with smaller kids will recognize this. I now search for “toilet” in Organic Maps and look for a suitable toilet in the map view. This works but the toilet in a bar or restaurant is typically only accessible for customers. It would be nice to see what toilets are freely accessible.\n\n**Describe the ideal solution**\n\nShow the OSM [`access`](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:access) or [`toilets:access`](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:toilets:access) tag in the Organic Maps detail view like the `wheelchair` and `fee` tags are.\n\nNodes tagged as `toilets:access` with “public” or “permissive” would be prime candidates. These might be toilets in a public library for example or even in a private place where toilets are publicly accessible (shopping mall, school, theater, etc.).\n\n**Describe alternatives you have considered**\n\nI use the map view to guess if the toilet is accessible or not. A toilet in a library or separate node on the street probably is while toilets within a bar or restaurants might not.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/11376/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693/events","html_url":"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693","id":1845202452,"node_id":"I_kwDOE1yAw85t-44U","number":5693,"title":"Show female/male restriction on toilets","user":{"login":"matkoniecz","id":899988,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTk4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/899988?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz","html_url":"https://github.com/matkoniecz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matkoniecz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3111569509,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTExNTY5NTA5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/UX","name":"UX","color":"DC35F9","default":false,"description":"User eXperience, an issue with usability","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3251837944,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjUxODM3OTQ0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/Classificator","name":"Classificator","color":"20A4A0","default":false,"description":"Classify object by types","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":4572829286,"node_id":"LA_kwDOE1yAw88AAAABEI_WZg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/POI%20Info","name":"POI Info","color":"F95207","default":false,"description":"Feature metadata, OSM tags that are displayed in Place Page","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2023-08-10T13:33:08Z","updated_at":"2025-08-24T11:11:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.**\r\nA clear and concise description of what the problem is. For example:\r\n\r\nFinding toilet using Organic Maps is irritating when many are female/male only.\r\n\r\nBrussels with many urinals is especially annoying case \r\n\r\n**Describe the solution you would like**\r\n\r\nShow this info like wheelchair accessibility.\r\n\r\nThis may be useful at least also for hairdressers \r\n\r\n**Describe alternatives you have considered**\r\n- How do you solve this issue now with Organic Maps or other apps?\r\n\r\nUse Vespucci in edit mode.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nSome places have male toilet on one side of square, female on other","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/5693/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431/events","html_url":"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431","id":2141120349,"node_id":"I_kwDOE1yAw85_nudd","number":7431,"title":"Toilets with drinking water are being shown as drinking water with toilets","user":{"login":"osmuser63783","id":127188803,"node_id":"U_kgDOB5S_Qw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127188803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783","html_url":"https://github.com/osmuser63783","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osmuser63783/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3160928250,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTYwOTI4MjUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/Styles","name":"Styles","color":"BF731C","default":false,"description":"Map drawing styles","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2024-02-18T18:08:31Z","updated_at":"2024-02-28T19:17:14Z","closed_at":"2024-02-28T00:56:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Describe the issue**\r\nWhen public toilets have drinking water, this is tagged as [`drinking_water=yes`](https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Key:drinking_water). This may mean that there is a water fountain, or it may merely mean that the water from the tap where people wash their hands is fit for human consumption.\r\n\r\nWhen an object has `amenity=toilets` and `drinking_water=yes`, in Organic Maps, the drinking water takes precedence: the icon shown on the map is the drinking water icon (a drop of water). When you select it, it says \"Drinking Water\" and there is a little icon to show that the object has toilets, like when a restaurant has toilets.\r\n\r\nIn other words, it gets shown to the user as a water fountain with toilets, when in reality it is public toilets with drinking water.\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce**\r\n1. Find any `amenity=toilets` with `drinking_water=yes` ([query](https://overpass-ultra.us/#m=13.67/41.9027/12.4694&q=LQhQGcBcE8BsFMBcACAFpSAHciD0uo55wA6SAJwEMBLWKSk8VXAe03gDsBbSzSW4sBbguJAFbgWHUCGChcAKlAAVVNXDJ1ySh2TwAHpS6YEyAPIA3eOUyVwGgI4BXa9BIry0TZGQsnPgCMvTHJicGoOAHNkSFR4ZAAlJ10A-0gpbQCWKwBCUAVcUABtAKz9RABvCtKWfQBfOoBdAG5QAApQDgB3ciKjTmoYAF4AInSBSHARxqKAE3IIgGsIyIB9LspIayHoYhbQAEpWvx9I+BYuZqA))\r\n2. Select it\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour**\r\nI would expect an object with `amenity=toilets` and `drinking_water=yes` to render on the map like public toilets. The toilets are the \"main tag\" (amenity) and the object will look like a public toilet from the outside.\r\n\r\nWhen you select the toilets, the \"title\" should be \"Toilet\", not \"Drinking Water\". It could show a little icon that makes it clear the water there is drinkable.\r\n\r\nThe toilets could show up both when searching for toilets and when searching for drinking water, but they should show up in the list of search results as \"Toilet\" not as \"Drinking Water\".\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20240218_185008_Firefox](https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/assets/127188803/1836a023-0990-457c-ae26-fd35ebce581b)\r\n![Screenshot_20240218_184856_Organic Maps](https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/assets/127188803/8307c9eb-2de1-4b8e-92bd-3d2d5fdcfb3c)\r\n\r\n\r\n**System information:**\r\n - Organic Maps version: 2024.02.06-11\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/7431/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/1648","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/1648/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/1648/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/1648/events","html_url":"https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps/issues/1648","id":1068318112,"node_id":"I_kwDOE1yAw84_rT2g","number":1648,"title":"Inappropriate \"toilet\" search results formatting; toilets=yes not shown in POIs Place Page","user":{"login":"pastk","id":18434508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDM0NTA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18434508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk","html_url":"https://github.com/pastk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pastk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3111569509,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTExNTY5NTA5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/UX","name":"UX","color":"DC35F9","default":false,"description":"User eXperience, an issue with usability","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3156160231,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTU2MTYwMjMx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/organicmaps/organicmaps/labels/UI","name":"UI","color":"6E632A","default":false,"description":"User interface issues","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2021-12-01T11:57:55Z","updated_at":"2024-02-10T19:01:03Z","closed_at":"2024-02-10T19:01:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocki